		<Meldungstext>\T\Y\F\J\NY\Y\S\J\NZ\L\S\K\N \L\S\G\A\INote:\L\S\K\I

0 = Compressor ON
 1-19 = Compressor OFF\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor ON:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvent\L\S\K\I - Requirement)\L\S\K\A
 0\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOK\L\S\K\I - A/C system switched on, all requirements met;\Y\S\K\N

J\L\S\K\I \L\B\K\ACompressor OFF:\L\S\K\I
 (\L\S\K\ACode\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\Iresult\L\S\K\I - condition)\L\S\K\A
 1\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOver-pressure\L\S\K\I - refrigerant pressure too high; thresholds dependent on refrigerant pressure; switch off at p \L\S\G\N&gt;=\L\S\K\I 32 bar, switch on at p \L\S\G\N=&lt;\L\S\K\I 24 bar;\L\S\K\A
 3\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IVacuum\L\S\K\I - refrigerant pressure too low, thresholds dependent on external temperature, switch off at p \L\S\G\N=&lt;\L\S\K\I 1.4 bar, switch on at p \L\S\G\N&gt;=\L\S\K\I 2.0 bar;\L\S\K\A
 5\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEngine start\L\S\K\I - Engine running time \L\S\G\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 1 sec (no engine start detected);\L\S\K\A
 6\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IECON\L\S\K\I - ECON operation (ECON button pressed or AC button not pressed);\L\S\K\A
 7\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IA/C OFF\L\S\K\I - fan switch in position 0;\L\S\K\A
 8\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IExternal temperature\L\S\K\I - external temperature too low, switch off at external temperature \L\S\G\N&lt;\L\S\K\I 1.5 °C or when control module gets no current/an implausible value via CAN, switch on at external temperature \L\S\G\N&gt;\L\S\K\N 2\L\S\K\I.5 °C;\L\S\K\A
 10\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IUnder-voltage\L\S\K\I - vehicle system voltage too low, &lt; 9.5 V;\L\S\K\A
 11\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEngine temperature indicator lamp switch off / coolant temperature too high\L\S\K\I - engine temperature &gt; 118 °C, (deactivated depending on software version);\L\S\K\A
 12\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ISwitch off by engine control module via CAN\L\S\K\I - reason e.g. engine temperature, coolant fan control module, kick down;\L\S\K\A
 13\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IOver-voltage\L\S\K\I - system voltage too high, V(term. 15) or (term. 30) &gt; 16 V;\L\S\K\A
 14\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IEvaporator temperature risk of icing\L\S\K\I - evaporator temperature too low;\L\S\K\A
 15\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\INo or faulty vehicle coding\L\S\K\I;\L\S\K\A
 16\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ICompressor activation\L\S\K\I - malfunction in activation path to control valve, e.g. open circuit/short-circuit to B+;\L\S\K\A
 17\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\IPressure sensor\L\S\K\I - no or implausible signal from pressure sensor (PWM signal);\L\S\K\A
 18\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\Ispeed switch off at standstill\L\S\K\I - switch off for a minimum time of 3 s at engine speed &gt; 3000 RPM and vehicle speed &lt; 15 km/h;\L\S\K\A
 19\L\S\K\I - \L\B\K\ILoad management\L\S\K\I - switch off via CAN from control module for vehicle electrical system (defrost raises this code again);</Meldungstext>
